This product reuses released research code, datasets, and model checkpoints. See
docs/REUSE.md for the full list, versions, and licenses. Notably it builds on the
BOHDI epistemic wrapper (https://github.com/sebasmos/bodhi-llms), OpenAI HealthBench
(the HealthBench Hard / Full evaluation sets), Google's MedGemma / Gemma checkpoints
(which carry their own model licenses), and Google's tunix + qwix and MaxText LoRA
training stacks.
